注解（重要）/ Note (important)
=======================================================================

pkgs/ 下的配方在编写过程中大量移植、改写或引用了第三方项目的构建脚本与
补丁（典型如 Arch Linux packaging/packages 仓库的 PKGBUILD 及其补丁，以及
各上游项目自带的补丁）。对于任何在配方中实际使用/包含的第三方补丁与脚本，
其版权与许可证一律以原项目、原作者为准，本文件不试图予以覆盖或转让；
上面的 0BSD 授权仅适用于 LankeOS 自有的配方逻辑与原创补丁部分。

The recipes under pkgs/ incorporate, adapt, or reference build scripts and
patches from third-party projects (notably PKGBUILDs and patches from the
Arch Linux packaging/packages repositories, and patches carried by upstream
projects themselves). Any third-party patches and scripts actually used in a
recipe remain under the copyright and license of their original project or
author, which this file does not purport to cover or transfer. The 0BSD grant
above applies only to the recipe logic and original patches authored for
LankeOS.
